What does this code print?

```js
function* ids() {
  let n = 0;
  while (true) {
    const reset = yield n++;
    if (reset) n = 0;
  }
}

const g = ids();
console.log(g.next().value, g.next().value, g.next(true).value, g.next().value);
```

